@intent Blowing the Dragon Cult horn far from any village sounds the horn and answers, on the action bar, that no raid can start
@step arena
gamemode creative
gamemode survival
time set day
weather clear
execute if entity @e[type=!minecraft:player] run kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]

@step blow the horn
item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with the_last_sword:dragon_cult_horn
@key key.use hold 1s
@expect sound minecraft:event.raid.horn within 3s
# displayClientMessage(..., true): the action bar, not chat
@expect actionbar message.the_last_sword.dragon_cult_horn_no_village within 10s
@shot horn
